# Only the static site gets uploaded, keeping the repo layout (client/ imports
# ../viewer/..., so the tree must be published as is, not copied): the root
# index.html, viewer/ and client/. Everything else (art/, crates/, docs/,
# work/, target/, *.jar, ...) stays out.
# It is all prebuilt locally by ./build.sh. viewer/pkg, viewer/textures.json
# and client/pkg are gitignored but still need to ship.
/*
!/index.html
!/viewer
!/client
!/vercel.json
